    "dimensionSource": "docs/plan/building-record.md: inner curtain height 11 m, thickness 4.7 m, inner court approximately 0.30 ha; twelve outer towers, six inner towers, two gates per circuit, approximately 18 m between circuits. Cadw, Beaumaris Castle (https://cadw.gov.wales/visit/places-to-visit/beaumaris-castle) and More about Beaumaris Castle (https://cadw.gov.wales/more-about-beaumaris-castle), unfinished south gatehouse and inner towers.",
